{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Teckting API - Basic Test",
    "description": "Ticket conversation API.\n\nFlow:\n1. Login (User) then Login (Admin)\n2. Create Ticket\n3. Add Reply (Admin) — optional image\n4. Add Reply (User) — optional image\n5. Show Ticket to see replies and image_url\n\nImage:\n- Body = form-data (not JSON)\n- Key: image\n- Types: jpg, jpeg, png, gif, webp (max 4MB)\n- Click Select Files on the image field\n- Run: php artisan storage:link\n\nAccounts (php artisan migrate:fresh --seed):\n- User: user@test.com / password\n- Admin: admin@test.com / password\n\nbase_url: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "user_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "ticket_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "reply_id",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
